cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "cardano-treasury-history-archive: A historical record of Cardano funding"
abstract: >-
  An open historical dataset of Cardano funding records across Project
  Catalyst, Treasury Fund 1, and Treasury Fund 2 budget-process data,
  normalized across source systems with provenance preserved and
  confidence labeled per record.
authors:
